      "message": "fix(checkpoint): preserve directory access and verify producer recovery\n\nUse a Linux path handle so anchored publication requires directory write and search access without introducing read access. Add actual preparation-consumer permission coverage and independent ownership, acquisition, preparation and builder fault regressions.\n\nThe six checkpoint modules pass 24 tests. Old-writer controls reproduce stale temporary failures; no native workload, resource threshold or frozen measurement input is changed.\n",
