      "tree": "7d36a4dab10389ef3fce843cf4cb4b488ae2bab2",
      "message": "test(checkpoint): isolate negative controls and require false claims\n\nKeep the deliberate descriptor-leak regression detectable while closing only matching owned descriptors after assertion failure. Preserve unrelated reused descriptor numbers. Require acquisition false-claim fields explicitly, including their presence and Boolean type.\n\nCombined focused validation passed 225 unique tests and 670 subtests with no failures, errors or skips, stable source hashes and unchanged process state. This is host tooling validation, not native qualification.\n",
